@@ -45,6 +45,14 @@ void NoteWebAuthnRefusedNotVisible(content::WebContents* contents);
 // running app's signature (com.apple.developer.team-identifier). An unsigned
 // or ad hoc signed build has no team and no profile authenticator, as before.
 // The app must also be signed with the group, whatever the engine.
+//
+// A release bundle in verification mode (ReArcReleaseVerification in the main
+// bundle's Info.plist: the copy scripts/release.sh runs its gates on, a --qa
+// bundle, the upgrade checks' copies of a previous release) gets a name no
+// build is ever signed with (tab/104). Such a copy is signed by the same team
